OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder charges after two
OL,4,Ainjured in house
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been charged with
OL,7,Fattempted murder after a man and a
OL,8,Fwoman aged in their 60s were found
OL,9,Finjured inside a house.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire Police said it was
OL,12,Fcalled to New Cheveley Road, in
OL,13,FNewmarket, at 21:34 GMT on Thursday
OL,14,Ffollowing reports of violence.
OL,16,FTwo people were found inside the
OL,17,Fproperty with serious but not
OL,18,Flife-threatening injuries, and were
OL,19,Ftaken to hospital. Police said the man
OL,20,Fhas since been discharged.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
