OL,5,
OL,6,FA 46-year-old woman and a 38-year-old
OL,7,Fman, both from Bury St Edmunds, have
OL,8,Fbeen charged with aggravated burglary
OL,9,Fand attempted murder, a police
OL,10,Fspokesperson said.
